1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:40,480
=Episode 6=

5
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,959
Capture the Zhang lady.

6
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,519
Get her!

7
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,360
Who's there?

8
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,759
Just an ordinary guy.

9
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,879
What did you shoot?

10
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,199
The finest salt from Gesa Sea.

11
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,199
Good thing it's salt.

12
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,520
Otherwise, if I had used real arrows,

13
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,520
I would've hurt you scoundrels.

14
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,159
It's salt.

15
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,960
It won't hurt anyone.

16
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,400
It's just a pity.

17
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,360
When I first arrived,

18
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,879
I could tell you were extraordinary.

19
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:37,080
Stop talking about
being extraordinary or not.

20
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,639
We're all just ordinary people.

21
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:43,599
Are you also
an accomplice of the Zhang lady?

22
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,680
I wasn't before.

23
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,080
Now, I am.

24
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,680
I had no choice, either.

25
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,319
No choice?

26
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,400
As soon as you walked in,

27
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,520
you smashed two of my liquor jars.

28
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:04,759
Even though they were empty,

29
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,000
they still belonged to me.

30
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,360
You smashed them without even asking.

31
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
That makes me quite unhappy.

32
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,920
Don't move.

33
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,480
This bow of mine

34
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,199
can shoot anything.

35
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:29,160
Let's talk this out nicely.

36
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,720
Impressive martial arts.

37
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,759
Just average.

38
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,079
What's your name?

39
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,399
Bancha.

40
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,160
I'll remember that.

41
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,399
Don't threaten me.

42
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:49,240
So you helped

43
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,639
this woman?

44
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,439
I helped today,

45
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:58,560
but we go our separate ways tomorrow.

46
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:02,079
Very well.

47
00:06:02,879 --> 00:06:04,360
You heard

48
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,680
what I just said.

49
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,160
She

50
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,839
has a grudge against me.

51
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:14,279
I have no grudge against her at all.

52
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,199
I'm relying on her to find the gold

53
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,879
so we can all get rich together.

54
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,519
Let's just forget

55
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,480
about what happened tonight.

56
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,920
Hey,

57
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:35,240
take the lad away.

58
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:35,920
Got it.

59
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,160
Let's go.

60
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:43,079
Miss Zhang,

61
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,560
I'll head to Lieyang Well first.

62
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:49,519
If I don't see you
before sunset tomorrow,

63
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:53,199
I'll kill him.

64
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,160
Officer.

65
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,160
Officer.

66
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,240
Lamp Shade should have had

67
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:07,040
100 taels of gold on him.

68
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,079
He gave it to me.

69
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,399
Oh.

70
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:16,040
It's not what you think.

71
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,480
The Zhang lady bought two jars

72
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,399
of highland barley liquor
from me for 100 taels.

73
00:08:22,319 --> 00:08:23,720
No one would believe that.

74
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,639
I used two big jars
of highland barley liquor

75
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:29,040
to trade for gold
that I can't eat or drink.

76
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:58,000
You guys, go

77
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,039
guard the door.

78
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,120
Yes, Coroner.

79
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,519
Luyao...

80
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:12,679
It's nothing.

81
00:09:13,639 --> 00:09:14,919
I just need to sit for a moment.

82
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,279
You're poisoned, too?

83
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,679
I'm immune to all poisons.

84
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,919
I just need to sit for a moment.

85
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:05,679
Futu,

86
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,360
where are we going?

87
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,679
To find a high ridge

88
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:11,879
to bury Lamp Shade.

89
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,240
What liquor

90
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:09,360
is worth 100 taels of gold?

91
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,799
His poison has been cured?

92
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,879
Yes,

93
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:37,679
but he won't wake up
until tomorrow morning.

94
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:39,480
That's too slow.

95
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,919
We like to administer poisons,

96
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:44,360
but rarely cure them.

97
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:51,519
At daybreak,

98
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,120
we return to Fengdu.

99
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:56,000
The job isn't finished yet.

100
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,200
How can you leave?

101
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,879
Then, add some more gold.

102
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:46,559
You guys from Liangzhou,

103
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:49,279
Heisong Post has been ruined like this.

104
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,279
You should report back tomorrow.

105
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,519
That goes without saying,

106
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:57,480
but we're not heading back tomorrow.

107
00:12:58,159 --> 00:13:01,600
Further west,
it won't be Liangzhou territory anymore.

108
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:04,519
We were assigned to assist Officer Pu.

109
00:13:04,759 --> 00:13:06,000
Wherever Officer Pu goes,

110
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,039
that's where we go.

111
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,440
Hold this yourself.

112
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:37,480
Fifteen minutes.

113
00:13:45,879 --> 00:13:47,240
Light one for Officer Pu.

114
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,679
Yes.

115
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,240
A little fumigation should do the trick.

116
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,240
Thank you.

117
00:14:12,879 --> 00:14:14,279
I wasn't poisoned.

118
00:14:20,039 --> 00:14:23,000
The Fengdu Couple used
corpse poison and cursed energy.

119
00:14:24,304 --> 00:14:25,870
Even if you weren't directly poisoned,

120
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,519
it still harms your spirit and mind.

121
00:14:30,559 --> 00:14:31,440
I'll only feel at ease

122
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:34,039
if everyone inhales
the incense for 15 minutes.

123
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,480
Come.

124
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,960
Pass these out to everyone.

125
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,799
Miss Zhang,

126
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,840
there are so many of us.

127
00:14:59,039 --> 00:15:00,039
So...

128
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,519
Thank you.

129
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,279
Come on, take it.

130
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,159
Hold this.

131
00:15:10,336 --> 00:15:12,030
Light it,
and pass it around to smell it.

132
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:12,559
Alright.

133
00:15:30,559 --> 00:15:31,320
Futu.

134
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:36,200
Bring the gold from the guy over there.

135
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:37,840
Okay.

136
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:55,799
Futu.

137
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,480
Give these five taels of gold

138
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,440
to the Ghost Couple.

139
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,639
When they die,

140
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,440
don't forget to take it back.

141
00:16:09,679 --> 00:16:10,480
Understood.

142
00:16:25,639 --> 00:16:27,600
Your family is dead?

143
00:16:30,799 --> 00:16:33,159
Isn't it hard
when you can't get your revenge?

144
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:41,720
Are there really 300,000
taels of gold in the Northwest?

145
00:16:43,639 --> 00:16:45,080
There are.

146
00:16:51,559 --> 00:16:52,799
How do you know?

147
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,320
Everyone knows.

148
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:05,400
Where is it then?

149
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,559
Where the flying eagles circle.

150
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,240
Where are the guardians of the gold?

151
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:21,279
Didn't they tell you to find them?

152
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:26,079
I used to think I had two enemies.

153
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,359
One who placed the escort order,

154
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,960
and one who poisoned my family.

155
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:33,680
But now, both turned out to be Tie Futu.

156
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,759
The guardians of the gold
have no grudge against me.

157
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,720
Why should I drag them into this?

158
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,640
Those jerks

159
00:17:44,319 --> 00:17:46,279
took away the lad with the long spear.

160
00:17:47,039 --> 00:17:49,559
If you don't reach Lieyang Well
by sunset tomorrow,

161
00:17:50,119 --> 00:17:51,640
he is dead.

162
00:17:54,039 --> 00:17:56,279
I hired Fang for 100 taels of gold.

163
00:17:57,759 --> 00:17:59,240
He took the gold with him.

164
00:18:00,759 --> 00:18:02,440
His life and death are up to fate now.

165
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,599
So you don't care about him?

166
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,640
Not in the slightest.

167
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:20,079
Futu,

168
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:22,759
Ghost Tycoon left.

169
00:18:24,288 --> 00:18:25,880
Did you give him the five taels of gold?

170
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,720
Yes.

171
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,240
He still insists on leaving.

172
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,440
Wake up!

173
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,519
Stop sleeping.

174
00:18:41,799 --> 00:18:42,680
Mount your horses.

175
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:43,640
Wake up!

176
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,519
Stop sleeping.

177
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,839
Wake up. Stop sleeping.

178
00:19:17,319 --> 00:19:18,200
Officer Pu.

179
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:34,279
Officer Pu.

180
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:37,790
Where is everyone?

181
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,599
They're all gone.

182
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:40,920
Gone?

183
00:19:42,119 --> 00:19:43,359
They all ran off.

184
00:19:43,359 --> 00:19:44,160
Coroner, stay...

185
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,359
Stay away from me.

186
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,319
Your poison has been cured.

187
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:02,799
What poison?

188
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,640
The cursed poison from
the Fengdu Ghost Couple.

189
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:09,232
What about the poison you gave me?

190
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:11,839
Cured as well.

191
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,880
From now on,

192
00:20:17,888 --> 00:20:19,350
you don't need to help me anymore.

193
00:20:23,079 --> 00:20:24,480
Who wanted to help you anyway?

194
00:20:29,599 --> 00:20:31,079
Where did those scoundrels go?

195
00:20:31,759 --> 00:20:33,160
They took Fang to Lieyang Well.

196
00:20:34,039 --> 00:20:36,400
If you're going to Lieyang Well,

197
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:38,160
we will follow.

198
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,240
Get lost.

199
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:41,079
You backstabbing traitors.

200
00:20:41,279 --> 00:20:42,599
What good are any of you?

201
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:45,000
Just you wait.

202
00:20:46,079 --> 00:20:47,680
I treated you to liquor,

203
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,680
and the gold is returned to you.

204
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,160
We are even now.

205
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,559
At dawn, we will part ways.

206
00:21:00,864 --> 00:21:03,930
At dawn, I'll return to Liangzhou to
offer incense to my father and brothers.

207
00:21:04,688 --> 00:21:06,550
And then, I'll head back
to Northern Shu.

208
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:10,070
The enemy is powerful,
and officials collaborate with bandits.

209
00:21:10,759 --> 00:21:12,759
As a mere woman,
there is nothing I can do.

210
00:21:17,599 --> 00:21:20,000
Officer Pu,
if you are willing to hear me out,

211
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:22,599
return to the Capital soon

212
00:21:23,312 --> 00:21:25,240
to avoid bringing
disaster upon yourself.

213
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,559
Officials collaborating with bandits?

214
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:31,790
Do those scoundrels even
deserve to be called officials?

215
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:35,750
He, a Commander-in-Chief,
doesn't even have a fixed rank.

216
00:21:37,039 --> 00:21:38,640
I, of the seventh rank,

217
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,200
am a real official.

218
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:43,000
I've said all I needed to say.

219
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,079
We depart tomorrow.

220
00:21:47,079 --> 00:21:48,359
Since there is no victim,

221
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:52,240
why should you risk
going west again, Officer Pu?

222
00:21:54,416 --> 00:21:56,480
If I wanted to leave,
I would have left long ago.

223
00:21:57,119 --> 00:21:59,160
I didn't even take
the 200 taels of gold.

224
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,480
What do you mean?

225
00:22:23,599 --> 00:22:24,960
One thought leads to heaven,

226
00:22:25,279 --> 00:22:26,440
and one thought leads to heck.

227
00:22:26,799 --> 00:22:28,119
Go west to risk your life,

228
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,759
or go back,

229
00:22:30,768 --> 00:22:32,790
and a hundred taels
will let you live a good life.

230
00:23:05,279 --> 00:23:06,119
Stop moving.

231
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:15,799
Think five taels of gold isn't enough,

232
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,160
so you're leaving?

233
00:23:28,599 --> 00:23:29,759
The people at Lieyang Well

234
00:23:29,759 --> 00:23:31,519
and Shiquan Fort

235
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,680
all died of poison.

236
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:35,799
Without us,

237
00:23:36,079 --> 00:23:37,519
how are you going to get things done?

238
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:39,839
How much is enough?

239
00:23:41,119 --> 00:23:42,240
Fifty taels.

240
00:23:47,119 --> 00:23:49,440
Would you take 100 taels?

241
00:23:52,799 --> 00:23:54,039
If you give it, we'll take it.

242
00:23:54,519 --> 00:23:56,000
Can you

243
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:58,119
protect my men and me

244
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:00,920
from the poison of
the guardians of the gold?

245
00:24:02,839 --> 00:24:04,920
We don't know if we can protect you,

246
00:24:05,359 --> 00:24:06,759
but with enough gold,

247
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,200
we

248
00:24:08,519 --> 00:24:09,880
will go with you.

249
00:24:16,039 --> 00:24:17,920
Give him another 95 taels.

250
00:25:29,319 --> 00:25:30,119
Officer Pu,

251
00:25:30,599 --> 00:25:32,880
I was just helping you pack.

252
00:25:33,759 --> 00:25:34,640
Well,

253
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:36,160
are you returning to Liangzhou first,

254
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:38,000
or going straight back to the Capital?

255
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,680
Where are they?

256
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:05,839
At crack of dawn,

257
00:26:05,839 --> 00:26:08,039
the men and women all left.

258
00:27:10,119 --> 00:27:11,200
They really left.

259
00:27:11,920 --> 00:27:13,000
Officer Pu,

260
00:27:14,039 --> 00:27:15,359
you should leave, too.

261
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,039
Where to?

262
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,960
What do they take me for?

263
00:27:46,240 --> 00:27:47,359
What a coincidence.

264
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:51,440
Overhearing you talk with
the seventh-rank official last night,

265
00:27:52,519 --> 00:27:54,880
I realized you were
still going to Lieyang Well.

266
00:27:55,119 --> 00:27:55,920
As it happens,

267
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:58,400
I'm returning to Wusu Sea,

268
00:27:58,400 --> 00:28:00,096
which also passes by Lieyang Well.

269
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:02,960
I thought I could rely on Officer Pu,

270
00:28:03,359 --> 00:28:05,000
but now I can't burden him any further.

271
00:28:08,079 --> 00:28:10,279
You're a good-hearted lady.

272
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,920
Last night, you told me

273
00:28:13,152 --> 00:28:15,270
you didn't want to burden
the guardians of the gold,

274
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:18,000
and now you don't want
to burden the official.

275
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:20,208
He's an Embroidered
Uniform Guard officer.

276
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:22,240
Catching bandits is his job.

277
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,640
How is that burdening him?

278
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,599
Officer Pu is an official

279
00:28:27,519 --> 00:28:28,559
and also a good man.

280
00:28:29,119 --> 00:28:30,400
Good people should live long.

281
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,559
Otherwise, in this world,

282
00:28:32,688 --> 00:28:34,576
there will only be
more and more evil people.

283
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:38,720
Aren't good people
supposed to kill off all the evil ones?

284
00:28:41,079 --> 00:28:42,279
That's what you think?

285
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:47,039
I am just an ordinary person.

286
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,200
We are all ordinary people.

287
00:28:53,359 --> 00:28:55,599
What good will it do
if you go to Lieyang Well?

288
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,000
It won't do any good,

289
00:29:00,079 --> 00:29:01,200
but I still have to go.

290
00:29:04,039 --> 00:29:05,279
In this world,

291
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:07,680
there are many wrongs
that cannot be avenged,

292
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:11,359
just as there are many favors
that cannot be repaid.

293
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:14,279
Many promises, even if agreed upon,

294
00:29:14,279 --> 00:29:15,720
might never be fulfilled.

295
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,319
It's great to have met you.

296
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:25,759
Yes.

297
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:29,599
I've died a hundred times.

298
00:29:30,559 --> 00:29:32,240
This time, I want to see

299
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,759
how I will die.

300
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:38,119
How could a person die a hundred times?

301
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:40,799
Do you never lie?

302
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:45,279
I never lie.

303
00:29:52,279 --> 00:29:53,920
May I ask you a few questions?

304
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:57,720
Or maybe

305
00:29:58,799 --> 00:29:59,920
just one question?

306
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:06,119
Do you really have to ask?

307
00:30:07,079 --> 00:30:08,359
You don't have to answer.

308
00:30:09,160 --> 00:30:10,480
Then it won't count as lying.

309
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:20,000
Do you like this place?

310
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:31,640
Vast skies and boundless land,

311
00:30:32,079 --> 00:30:33,920
a flying eagle over the great land!

312
00:30:34,319 --> 00:30:36,440
I like it very much!

313
00:31:03,559 --> 00:31:04,480
Coroner!

314
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:05,880
Coming.

315
00:31:06,079 --> 00:31:07,119
Officer Pu.

316
00:31:11,079 --> 00:31:11,920
Officer Pu,

317
00:31:12,359 --> 00:31:13,880
I'm carrying the gold for you.

318
00:31:14,839 --> 00:31:18,240
How much does a coroner make a month?

319
00:31:19,039 --> 00:31:20,039
Five taels

320
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,200
of silver.

321
00:31:21,319 --> 00:31:23,640
With tips for helping
the Deputy Military Commissioner,

322
00:31:23,759 --> 00:31:25,559
it comes to seven
or eight taels a month.

323
00:31:25,559 --> 00:31:27,039
With 100 taels of gold on your back,

324
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:29,119
you could run away and start over.

325
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,640
This belongs to you, Officer Pu.

326
00:31:30,839 --> 00:31:31,839
It's not mine.

327
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,640
You can take it.

328
00:31:34,559 --> 00:31:36,319
Gold is great,

329
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:38,279
but if I run away,

330
00:31:38,559 --> 00:31:40,720
I'll be a fugitive for
the rest of my life.

331
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:41,720
But why

332
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,720
did you tell me
to take 200 taels at first?

333
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,799
It's different.

334
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:47,839
You're a superior officer.

335
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:49,359
The gold

336
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,039
was a gift from the Deputy.

337
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:54,319
No one back in the Capital
would ever know.

338
00:31:54,759 --> 00:31:56,559
Borrowing 20 guards

339
00:31:56,759 --> 00:31:58,440
and staying out of Tie Futu's way

340
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,960
was also instructed by the Deputy?

341
00:32:03,519 --> 00:32:06,000
Are you going to take the fall for him?

342
00:32:08,759 --> 00:32:10,759
This matter must be
thoroughly investigated.

343
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,240
If I leave,

344
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:14,624
the Embroidered Uniform Guard
will just send someone else.

345
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:18,240
Since we're already
so familiar with you,

346
00:32:18,359 --> 00:32:20,880
there's no need for them
to send anyone else.

347
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:23,200
Deputy Yu is finished.

348
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:25,480
I'll pretend last night never happened.

349
00:32:25,839 --> 00:32:26,880
Keep going,

350
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,480
listen to me,

351
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:32,000
and I can still guarantee your
monthly salary of five taels of silver.

352
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:36,720
Is it that hard for you?

353
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:38,839
Officer Pu, well, it's not...

354
00:32:38,839 --> 00:32:40,119
There is a way.

355
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,720
Once done, it won't be hard at all.

356
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,160
What way?

357
00:32:43,359 --> 00:32:45,079
In this great desolate desert,

358
00:32:45,279 --> 00:32:46,559
have the guards kill me,

359
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:47,720
and your problem is solved.

360
00:32:47,776 --> 00:32:49,552
Kill an
Embroidered Uniform Guard officer?

361
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,240
Why would the men ever listen to that?

362
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,599
Glad you realize that.

363
00:32:56,599 --> 00:32:58,519
All land under
heaven belongs to the King.

364
00:32:58,839 --> 00:33:00,920
Vast as this desert may be,

365
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,400
they are still imperial soldiers.

366
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:05,039
Yes, you're right, Officer Pu.

367
00:33:07,839 --> 00:33:09,160
Give me the hundred taels of gold.

368
00:33:12,799 --> 00:33:14,640
So you still want the gold?

369
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:21,920
I don't need you

370
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,000
to carry my gold anymore.

371
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:26,000
Yes, sir.

372
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:34,440
Where did the lad come from?

373
00:35:35,239 --> 00:35:37,559
I wish he were one of my men.

374
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:52,360
Stay still.

375
00:35:53,039 --> 00:35:54,000
What's your name?

376
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,159
Fang.

377
00:35:57,559 --> 00:35:59,159
The hundred taels of gold

378
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:02,159
the Zhang lady gave you is gone.

379
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,480
Gone is gone.

380
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:05,639
Don't move.

381
00:36:06,199 --> 00:36:08,559
I can give you another hundred taels,

382
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:11,599
but you must do as I say.

383
00:36:12,519 --> 00:36:13,679
Good and evil cannot coexist.

384
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,559
Why would I side with you bandits?

385
00:36:18,239 --> 00:36:19,719
At such a young age,

386
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:21,760
what do you know about good and evil?

387
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:28,599
Those who kill and rob deserve death!

388
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:32,480
Are you that close with the Zhang lady?

389
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,000
Isn't it all for the gold?

390
00:36:35,159 --> 00:36:36,480
What do I need gold for?

391
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:38,119
Then, why are you doing this?

392
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:40,280
I was asked by someone,

393
00:36:40,599 --> 00:36:41,760
and I stay loyal to my word.

394
00:36:45,079 --> 00:36:46,079
Let me ask you.

395
00:36:46,400 --> 00:36:47,639
At Heisong Post,

396
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:49,960
who was the man

397
00:36:50,119 --> 00:36:51,199
shooting salt?

398
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:53,599
I don't know.

399
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:56,079
When the Tatar was shooting salt,

400
00:36:56,079 --> 00:36:57,840
he had already been poisoned by me.

401
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:01,199
Before he was poisoned,

402
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:02,920
you asked the Liangzhou guards

403
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:05,800
how they would answer to
the Deputy Military Commissioner.

404
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:10,480
You know Yu Hou?

405
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:14,880
No, I don't.

406
00:37:16,559 --> 00:37:18,199
At Liangzhou Escort Agency,

407
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:20,599
when the Zhang lady
was testing for poison,

408
00:37:21,679 --> 00:37:24,960
did she mention anything
about the guardians of the gold?

409
00:37:26,159 --> 00:37:28,079
Whatever she said
has nothing to do with me.

410
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:30,079
Then what's it got to do with you?

411
00:37:31,119 --> 00:37:32,239
Whoever attacks her,

412
00:37:32,639 --> 00:37:33,599
I'll attack them.

413
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:34,840
That's it.

414
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:44,719
Now that we're at Lieyang Well,

415
00:37:45,239 --> 00:37:46,719
if she isn't here,

416
00:37:47,559 --> 00:37:48,880
I'll kill you.

417
00:37:50,199 --> 00:37:52,519
If she comes and doesn't listen to me,

418
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:55,559
I'll kill you right in front of her.

419
00:37:59,199 --> 00:38:00,239
Still laughing?

420
00:38:01,559 --> 00:38:02,199
Behave yourself.

421
00:38:02,199 --> 00:38:02,760
Get over here.

422
00:38:07,559 --> 00:38:09,360
I will kill you

423
00:38:10,199 --> 00:38:11,400
right in front of her.

424
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:19,239
Flying Eagle,

425
00:38:20,159 --> 00:38:22,639
ask the Qin Demon
of Mount Pingfeng to help me.

426
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,159
Are you scared?

427
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:31,719
You ignorant fool.

428
00:38:34,559 --> 00:38:35,920
Didn't you hear

429
00:38:36,519 --> 00:38:37,800
what I said?

430
00:38:39,599 --> 00:38:41,440
The Qin Demon will demand a lot of gold.

431
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:44,280
Give him as much as he asks for.

432
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:33,880
Don't kill it.

433
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,320
Let it go.

434
00:39:39,119 --> 00:39:40,280
For days,

435
00:39:40,592 --> 00:39:42,000
it's been the only one around.

436
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:44,199
Keep fanning.

437
00:39:51,679 --> 00:39:53,239
It's so hot.

438
00:39:53,719 --> 00:39:56,440
Why are you standing in the sun?

439
00:39:57,320 --> 00:39:58,679
I like the sun.

440
00:40:00,599 --> 00:40:02,159
Then don't complain about the heat.

441
00:40:07,679 --> 00:40:08,239
Father,

442
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,079
can I splash some water on myself?

443
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:13,760
Don't call me Father.

444
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,760
Call me Bana.

445
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,960
You are my father.

446
00:40:19,568 --> 00:40:21,190
That's why you shouldn't call me Father.

447
00:40:21,199 --> 00:40:23,800
You said not to when others are around.

448
00:40:24,519 --> 00:40:26,079
There's no one around now.

449
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:29,199
There are fewer and
fewer people in Lieyang Well.

450
00:40:30,719 --> 00:40:32,159
Isn't that a good thing?

451
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,719
I prefer having no one around,

452
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:37,239
so I can call you Father.

453
00:40:43,199 --> 00:40:44,000
Father.

454
00:40:49,159 --> 00:40:49,880
Father.

455
00:41:39,480 --> 00:41:40,199
Father,

456
00:41:40,679 --> 00:41:41,960
someone's coming.

457
00:41:47,559 --> 00:41:49,599
Am I the only one
who came to Lieyang Well?

458
00:41:58,320 --> 00:41:58,920
Father,

459
00:41:59,719 --> 00:42:00,679
it's him again.

460
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:04,079
Don't kill him.

461
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:08,199
He was one of the 15 people last time.

462
00:42:24,800 --> 00:42:26,199
Do you kill everyone who comes here?

463
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:32,840
Your son

464
00:42:33,679 --> 00:42:34,599
has killed before?

465
00:42:35,679 --> 00:42:37,760
I thought it was a fly.

466
00:42:38,599 --> 00:42:40,360
He can only kill flies.

467
00:42:44,599 --> 00:42:45,400
No need to look.

468
00:42:48,320 --> 00:42:49,480
It's just me.

469
00:42:51,519 --> 00:42:54,559
It's rare for a person
to travel west alone.

470
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:58,800
It's rare for someone
who almost died here once

471
00:42:59,679 --> 00:43:00,679
to come back.

472
00:43:01,719 --> 00:43:02,480
Am I right?

473
00:43:11,780 --> 00:43:14,420
(Preview of the Next Episode)

474
00:43:15,119 --> 00:43:16,880
You came here seeking death.

475
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:18,920
It's easy for me to kill you.

476
00:43:20,760 --> 00:43:22,199
The guardians of the gold are here.

477
00:43:22,688 --> 00:43:24,030
Light a stick of water incense

478
00:43:24,639 --> 00:43:26,039
every 10 meters.

479
00:43:26,064 --> 00:43:27,990
Fifteen minutes later,
the moisture will thicken,

480
00:43:28,112 --> 00:43:30,280
and the whole street
will be covered in water mist.

481
00:43:30,559 --> 00:43:32,480
When Tie Futu and the others get here,

482
00:43:32,599 --> 00:43:34,519
they'll start killing each other, right?

483
00:43:34,832 --> 00:43:36,592
Just like my father and brothers did.

484
00:43:43,281 --> 00:43:48,281
=Remnants of Gold=
